02', 'Metal Forming', '2', 'Metal Forming examines Forging within Manufacturing Processes. Key technical concerns include Plastic deformation, material integrity, grain flow, energy input, with emphasis on how the contained topics are represented, analysed, and applied within their stated assumptions.', 'MSD_METAL_FORMING', 'Active'), ('MOD_COURSE_022_M03', 'Joining Processes', '3', 'Joining Processes examines Arc welding within Manufacturing Processes. Key technical concerns include Fusion, heat transfer, metallurgical control, joint integrity, with emphasis on how the contained topics are represented, analysed, and applied within their stated assumptions.', 'MSD_JOINING_PROCESSES', 'Active'), ('MOD_COURSE_022_M04', 'Machining', '4', 'Machining examines Lathe operations within Manufacturing Processes. Key technical concerns include Material removal, geometric accuracy, cutting mechanics, productivity, with emphasis on how the contained topics are represented, analysed, and applied within their stated assumptions.', 'MSD_MACHINING', 'Active'), ('MOD_COURSE_022_M05', 'Non-traditional Machining', '5', 'Non-traditional Machining examines Electrical discharge machining within Manufacturing Processes. Key technical concerns include Localized energy transfer, material removal, process control, with emphasis on how the contained topics are represented, analysed, and applied within their stated assumptions.', 'MSD_NON_TRADITIONAL_MACHINING', 'Active'), ('MOD_COURSE_023_M01', 'Failure Theories', '1', 'Failure Theories examines Von Mises within Design of Machine Elements. Key technical concerns include Distortion energy, yielding, multiaxial stress, with emphasis on how the contained topics are represented, analysed, and applied within their stated assumptions.', 'MSD_FAILURE_THEORIES', 'Active'), ('MOD_COURSE_023_M02', 'Fatigue Design', '2', 'Fatigue Design examines Goodman diagram within Design of Machine Elements. Key technical concerns include Fatigue, mean-stress effect,