, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'CAM workflows; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of CAM workflows, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; CAD/CAM', 'Active'), ('KCR_000496', 'tool-path generation', 'Engineering & Technology', 'CAD/CAM', 'Technical Concept', 'Computing machining trajectories from part geometry, cutting tools, stock, and process parameters.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of tool-path generation within CAD/CAM, particularly where the Computer-Aided Manufacturing module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of tool-path generation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Computing machining trajectories from part geometry, cutting tools, stock, and process parameters. Within Computer-Aided Manufacturing, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of tool-path generation within CAD/CAM, particularly where the Computer-Aided Manufacturing module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of tool-path generation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'tool-path generation; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of tool-path generation, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; CAD/CAM', 'Active'), ('KCR_000497', 'verification', 'Engineering & Technology', 'CAD/CAM; Mechatronics', 'Technical Concept', 'Process of determining whether a model, design, implementation, or 