iagnosis; maintenance', 'Thermodynamic performance, refrigeration-cycle analysis, or equipment sizing does not by itself establish preventive maintenance, repairability, or asset-life extension; condition, deterioration, maintenance, or service-life evidence is required.', 'Curriculum-derived disciplinary scope', 'Active'), ('GR_COURSE_038', 'Course', 'Internal Combustion Engines', 'Otto cycle; Diesel cycle; dual cycle; two-stroke/four-stroke; engine configurations; cylinder; piston; crankshaft; valve train; lubrication; cooling; air intake; turbocharging; fuel injection; ignition; mixture formation; flame development; ignition delay; knock; combustion efficiency; heat release; brake power; indicated power; efficiency; specific fuel consumption; performance testing; NOx; particulate matter; CO; hydrocarbons; oxidation catalysts; particulate filters; electronic control; sensors; actuators; diagnostics; calibration', '', 'Curriculum-derived disciplinary scope', 'Active'), ('GR_COURSE_039', 'Course', 'Engineering Materials', 'crystal structures; defects; diffusion; phase structure; mechanical properties; steels; cast irons; phase transformations; heat treatment; alloying; aluminium; copper; titanium; nickel alloys; selection criteria; thermoplastics; thermosets; elastomers; ceramics; processing-property relations; fibres; matrices; laminates; anisotropy; failure mechanisms; casting; forming; machining; joining; additive manufacturing; Ashby-style selection; corrosion; fatigue; fracture; wear; failure analysis', '', 'Curriculum-derived disciplinary scope', 'Active'), ('GR_COURSE_040', 'Course', 'Chemical Process Calculations', 'SI units; dimensional consistency; concentration; flow rates; pressure; temperature; mass conservation; component balances; basis selection; recycle; purge; stoichiometry; conversion; yield; selectivity; extent of reaction; enthalpy; heat capacity; phase change; heat effects; steady-state energy balances; coupled balances; process streams; heat i